  'Triage each advisory against actual adapters/options, update to patched supported versions and replace incompatible storage adapters as needed. Review major upgrades explicitly; avoid npm audit fix --force, which suggests downgrades for some chains. Upgrade installer tooling and urllib3, lock Python dependencies and enforce scans in CI.',
